==Differences between the movie and the manga==
{{incomplete|section}}
* [[Baron Alberto]]'s role is expanded somewhat.
* {{OBP|Tonio|M10}} is [[Godey]]'s grandson, whereas he was Godey's great-grandson in the [[M10|movie]].
* [[Maury]], [[Allegra]], and {{OBP|Kai|M10}} have greatly reduced roles. 
* {{an|Brock}} and {{an|Dawn}} are with Tonio in his lab when he discovers that Palkia is within [[Alamos Town]].
* {{TRT}} isn't using disguises while working as Baron Alberto's reporters.
* In the movie, Tonio finds a photo of [[Alicia|Alice's grandmother]] and gives it to her, whereas in the manga, [[Alice]] already had this photo with her.
* In the manga, the old photo shows only a young Alicia, whereas in the movie, the old photo shows Alicia with Godey.
**In addition, "[[Oración]]" was not recorded on the back of this photo, Alice already knew about the existence of this song and its name in the manga version.
* Tonio does not tell Alice the truth that it was {{OBP|Darkrai|M10}} who saved her as a child, whereas he told her in the movie version.
* The manga ends with {{Ash}}'s words ''"I'll be challenge you again someday"'', when he and {{ashfr|his friends}} see the shadow of the surviving Darkrai.

